r and independently rereads the complete artifact. Both workflow jobs and the Pages environment allow only main. Initial publication is one automatic main push; the existing manual trigger remains available for a needed retry after failure.\n\nValidation: 20 infrastructure fixture tests and four original extractor corruption tests passed; exact 16-file staged tree matches independently reviewed candidate pins. The build marker is the original 53-byte value. Actual hosted/public byte and native-browser admission checks follow deployment.\n\nThis preserves v0.57.0 historical behavior, including its known portrait offline-control displacement. The separately qualified v0.57.1 patch addresses that defect. Archival does not accept P01 or advance another phase.\n","created_at":"2026-09-15T12:23:08Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T12:23:39Z","closed_at":"2026-09-15T12:23:38Z","merged_at":"2026-09-15T12:23:38Z","merge_commit_sha":"740878b685b08edb40db5494f7ebbe71536b523a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline-archive-14/pulls/1/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline-archive-14/pulls/1/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline-archive-14/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline-archive-14/issues/1/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline-archive-14/statuses/9fc20285e07d941d4f4c729c1243dee3cf4d2227","head":{"label":"mekhovov:codex/p01-preserve-v057","ref":"codex/p01-preserve-v057","sha":"9fc20285e07d941d4f4c729c1243dee3cf4d2227","user":{"login":"mekhovov","id":194539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDUzOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://ap